      "instance_name": "audience_id",
      "label": "audience description",
      "description": "The target community for this meme is individuals who hold or are exposed to racist ideologies, particularly those who support Donald Trump or white nationalist politics. The meme is designed to provoke outrage or reinforce negative perceptions about both the person depicted (of Middle Eastern or South Asian descent) and Trump supporters by conflating political support with racial prejudice. It uses the visual of a person of color to imply that voting for Trump is inherently racist, targeting those who may be sympathetic to or unaware of the harmful stereotype being promoted. The meme also targets online communities that engage in political discourse, especially those critical of Trump or his supporters, by using the image to delegitimize political choices through association with racism.",
